{"no":2,"title":"Breakfast or Lunch?","titleZh":"早餐还是午餐？","audio":"audio/L02.mp3","duration":92.64,"question":{"en":"Why was the writer's aunt surprised?","zh":"作者的姑母为什么感到惊讶？"},"sentences":[{"i":0,"t":13.38,"t2":19.69,"en":"Why was the writer's aunt surprised?","zh":"作者的姑母为什么感到惊讶？","meta":true},{"i":1,"t":19.69,"t2":21.83,"en":"It was Sunday.","zh":"那是个星期天。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"was Sunday","g":"动词短语"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般过去时","主系表句型"]},{"i":2,"t":21.83,"t2":25.34,"en":"I never get up early on Sundays.","zh":"星期天我是从来不早起的。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"never get up early","g":"短语动词"},{"c":"PP","x":"on Sundays","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["一般现在时","否定的 never","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":3,"t":25.34,"t2":29.8,"en":"I sometimes stay in bed until lunchtime.","zh":"有时我要一直躺到吃午饭的时候。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"sometimes stay","g":"动词短语"},{"c":"PP","x":"in bed","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"until lunchtime","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["一般现在时","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":4,"t":29.8,"t2":34.93,"en":"Last Sunday I got up very late.","zh":"上个星期天，我起得很晚。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"Sunday got up late","g":"短语动词"},{"c":"ADVP","x":"very late","g":"副词短语"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["一般过去时","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":5,"t":34.93,"t2":38.63,"en":"I looked out of the window.","zh":"我望望窗外。","chunks":[{"c":"PP","x":"out of the window","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"PP","x":"of the window","g":"介词短语作定语/表语"},{"c":"NP","x":"the window","g":"冠词+名"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","主谓句型"]},{"i":6,"t":38.63,"t2":42.3,"en":"It was dark outside.","zh":"外面一片昏暗。","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"was dark outside","g":"动词短语"}],"pat":"主系表","gp":["一般过去时","主系表句型"]},{"i":7,"t":42.3,"t2":45.79,"en":"'What a day!' I thought.","zh":"“鬼天气！”我想。","chunks":[{"c":"NP","x":"' What a day","g":"名词短语"}],"pat":"主谓","gp":["一般过去时","主谓句型"]},{"i":8,"t":45.79,"t2":48.79,"en":"'It's raining again.'","zh":"“又下雨了。”","chunks":[{"c":"VP","x":"'s raining again","g":"进行时态谓语"}],"pat":"主谓+状语","gp":["一般现在时","主谓+状语句型"]},{"i":9,"t":48.79,"t2":52.6,"en":"Just then, the 